  "prefLabel": "Pes 202.22 Recess and Adjournment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 202.22 Recess and Adjournment. The board shall, from time to time, at the request of any party or on its own initiative, recess, adjourn, and continue any hearing as shall be necessary for the orderly conduct of the proceeding.\n\nSource. #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8058, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-A, eff 10-3-12",
